IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mca-collisions`

-- Maritime Conventions Act 1911, ss 1, 2, 3, 6, 8 and 9(5) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_maritime-conventions-act-1911.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 1`

#ASSERT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `damage to one of the colliding ships`
#ASSERT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `loss of cargo on a colliding ship`
#ASSERT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `loss of freight`
#ASSERT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `loss of passage money`
#ASSERT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `loss of charter hire`
#ASSERT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `salvage expenses caused by the fault`
#ASSERT NOT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `loss of life on board a colliding ship`
#ASSERT NOT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `personal injury on board a colliding ship`
#ASSERT NOT `liability is divided by degree of fault` `damage to a pier struck by the ships`

#ASSERT `this ship's share of the property loss` 60 40 TRUE 100000 EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `this ship's share of the property loss` 75 25 TRUE 200000 EQUALS 150000
#ASSERT `this ship's share of the property loss` 60 40 FALSE 100000 EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT `this ship's share of the property loss` 0 100 TRUE 100000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `this ship's share of the property loss` 0 100 FALSE 100000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `this ship's share of the property loss` 100 0 TRUE 100000 EQUALS 100000

§ `s 2`

#ASSERT `liability is joint and several` `loss of life on board a colliding ship`
#ASSERT `liability is joint and several` `personal injury on board a colliding ship`
#ASSERT NOT `liability is joint and several` `damage to one of the colliding ships`

#ASSERT `what the injured person may recover from the sued ship's owners` TRUE 500000 EQUALS 500000
#ASSERT `what the injured person may recover from the sued ship's owners` FALSE 500000 EQUALS 0

